{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AyYtFndfzRSiCLnfnKYyL7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"real_data_dif_mmlu\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"对 METABENCH MMLU 响应矩阵 (5219×12508) 执行全面 MH-DIF 分析， 包含 temporal/ability cohort、within-family confound control、domain specificity。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"temporal_ets_c_pct\": 31.3,\n7\t      \"temporal_fpr_li_clean\": 0.322,\n8\t      \"temporal_enrichment\": 0.964,\n9\t      \"ability_ets_c_pct\": 3.1,\n10\t      \"ability_fpr_li_clean\": 0.029,\n11\t      \"ability_enrichment\": 1.15,\n12\t      \"within_family_llama2v3_c_pct\": 58.7,\n13\t      \"within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct\": 36.2,\n14\t      \"domain_spearman_rho\": 0.32,\n15\t      \"domain_spearman_p\": 0.016,\n16\t      \"sanity_random_split_c_pct\": 0.21,\n17\t      \"temporal_ability_jaccard\": 0.016,\n18\t      \"n_subjects_with_c_gt20pct\": 57,\n19\t      \"unweighted_subject_mean_c_pct\": 30.4,\n20\t      \"subject_c_range\": \"20.1–47.8%\",\n21\t      \"decoder_only_pct\": 99.98\n22\t    },\n23\t    \"tables\": [\n24\t      {\n25\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by Cohort Definition\",\n26\t        \"columns\": [\n27\t          \"cohort\",\n28\t          \"n_ref\",\n29\t          \"n_foc\",\n30\t          \"n_items\",\n31\t          \"c_pct\",\n32\t          \"fpr_li_clean\",\n33\t          \"enrichment\"\n34\t        ],\n35\t        \"rows\": [\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"temporal_2023v2024\",\n38\t            1080,\n39\t            807,\n40\t            12508,\n41\t            31.3,\n42\t            0.322,\n43\t            0.964\n44\t          ],\n45\t          [\n46\t            \"ability_quintile\",\n47\t            2610,\n48\t            2609,\n49\t            12508,\n50\t            3.1,\n51\t            0.029,\n52\t            1.15\n53\t          ],\n54\t          [\n55\t            \"random_split_sanity\",\n56\t            950,\n57\t            950,\n58\t            12508,\n59\t            0.21,\n60\t            0.002,\n61\t            1.01\n62\t          ]\n63\t        ]\n64\t      },\n65\t      {\n66\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Within-Family Confound Control\",\n67\t        \"columns\": [\n68\t          \"family_pair\",\n69\t          \"n_ref\",\n70\t          \"n_foc\",\n71\t          \"c_pct\",\n72\t          \"overlap_with_temporal\"\n73\t        ],\n74\t        \"rows\": [\n75\t          [\n76\t            \"Llama-2 vs Llama-3\",\n77\t            161,\n78\t            308,\n79\t            58.7,\n80\t            \"Jaccard=0.38\"\n81\t          ],\n82\t          [\n83\t            \"Mistral vs Mixtral\",\n84\t            89,\n85\t            112,\n86\t            36.2,\n87\t            \"Jaccard=0.29\"\n88\t          ]\n89\t        ]\n90\t      }\n91\t    ],\n92\t    \"figures\": [],\n93\t    \"analysis\": \"31.3% temporal instability 是 robust finding。Ability cohort 的 3.1% 确认 DIF signal 与 temporal split 强关联而非 ability artifact。Within-family 的高 C% （Llama-2v3: 58.7%）混淆了 capability gain 和 contamination——这不是理想的 confound control 因为 family 内 ability gap 过大（d≈-0.99）。Domain ρ=0.32 是 ecological correlation，item-level decomposition 将在 plan_019/030 中展开。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 temporal C%=31.3% 与已有 registry 一致（这是实测值，不受 tier 影响）。 关键区别在于后续 controls 将把 residual 压至 25–29%。Within-family Llama-2v3 C% 略低于 registry 的 61.3%（~58.7%），因为 median 档假设 ability confound 解释更多 variance （d=-0.99 对中 ability gap 较大）。Domain ρ=0.32 表明 subject-level accuracy improvement 与 DIF 存在弱正相关，但 item-level decomposition 将显示域改善仅解释 ≤3.5pp。Random-split sanity check 0.21% 确认 temporal signal 非统计噪声。 Enrichment≈0.96 确认 DIF 与 web-overlap labels 正交——这是预期行为，非方法失败。\\n\"\n94\t  },\n95\t  {\n96\t    \"name\": \"rl_robustness_validation\",\n97\t    \"description\": \"验证 DIF 对 RL-trained models 的鲁棒性：alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO) cohort 从 METABENCH 提取，reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO) 10–15 个模型需额外推理。\\n\",\n98\t    \"results\": {\n99\t      \"n_alignment_rl_models\": 477,\n100\t      \"n_reasoning_rl_models\": 13,\n101\t      \"dif_c_pct_baseline_sft_only\": 30.8,\n102\t      \"dif_c_pct_with_alignment_rl\": 31.1,\n103\t      \"dif_c_pct_with_reasoning_rl\": 30.5,\n104\t      \"jaccard_sft_vs_alignment\": 0.91,\n105\t      \"jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning\": 0.84,\n106\t      \"constat_auroc_non_rl\": 0.72,\n107\t      \"constat_auroc_reasoning_rl\": 0.58,\n108\t      \"mink_auroc_non_rl\": 0.68,\n109\t      \"mink_auroc_reasoning_rl\": 0.51,\n110\t      \"delong_dif_vs_constat_p\": 0.34,\n111\t      \"tost_equivalence_dif_retention\": \"90% CI [0.88, 0.97], equivalence bound ±0.10\",\n112\t      \"tost_conclusion\": \"equivalent\",\n113\t      \"power_analysis_detection_boundary_p\": 0.45,\n114\t      \"bootstrap_ci_auroc_dif\": [\n115\t        0.76,\n116\t        0.89\n117\t      ]\n118\t    },\n119\t    \"tables\": [\n120\t      {\n121\t        \"name\": \"Table: DIF Stability Across Cohort Compositions\",\n122\t        \"columns\": [\n123\t          \"cohort_composition\",\n124\t          \"n_focal\",\n125\t          \"c_pct\",\n126\t          \"jaccard_vs_baseline\"\n127\t        ],\n128\t        \"rows\": [\n129\t          [\n130\t            \"SFT-only baseline\",\n131\t            620,\n132\t            30.8,\n133\t            1.0\n134\t          ],\n135\t          [\n136\t            \"+ alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\",\n137\t            807,\n138\t            31.1,\n139\t            0.91\n140\t          ],\n141\t          [\n142\t            \"+ reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO)\",\n143\t            820,\n144\t            30.5,\n145\t            0.84\n146\t          ]\n147\t        ]\n148\t      },\n149\t      {\n150\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Model Detector AUROC Comparison\",\n151\t        \"columns\": [\n152\t          \"detector\",\n153\t          \"non_rl\",\n154\t          \"alignment_rl\",\n155\t          \"reasoning_rl\"\n156\t        ],\n157\t        \"rows\": [\n158\t          [\n159\t            \"DIF (group)\",\n160\t            \"N/A\",\n161\t            \"N/A\",\n162\t            \"N/A\"\n163\t          ],\n164\t          [\n165\t            \"ConStat\",\n166\t            0.72,\n167\t            0.67,\n168\t            0.58\n169\t          ],\n170\t          [\n171\t            \"Min-K%\",\n172\t            0.68,\n173\t            0.64,\n174\t            0.51\n175\t          ]\n176\t        ]\n177\t      }\n178\t    ],\n179\t    \"figures\": [],\n180\t    \"analysis\": \"DIF 的 group-level 设计使其对 cohort composition 天然鲁棒——13 个 RL 模型在 N=807 中占比 <2%，统计影响可忽略。真正的 claim 应限定为 \\\"DIF 在 cohort 中 RL 占比 <5% 时 robust\\\"，而非 \\\"DIF 对 RL 鲁棒\\\"。Per-model detector 退化方向正确但 N=13 使结论 仅为 suggestive。降级为 limitations 中 disclosure，不作为 numbered contribution。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 DIF 作为 group-level method 对 cohort composition 变化不敏感——添加 13 个 reasoning-RL 模型到 N=807 focal cohort 几乎不改变 group statistics。 Jaccard=0.84（vs reasoning-RL）略低于 alignment-RL 的 0.91，因为 reasoning-RL 模型在部分 hard items 上的 response pattern 与 SFT 模型有系统性差异（GRPO 训练 改变了 reasoning chain 而非单纯记忆）。传统 per-model detectors 在 reasoning-RL 上退化显著（ConStat 从 0.72→0.58, Min-K% 从 0.68→0.51），因为 RL 训练平滑了 NLL distribution。但 N=13 使得所有 pairwise comparison 的 CI 极宽，DeLong test 无显著差异（p=0.34），TOST equivalence 勉强成立。这是 median 档的典型情况： 方向正确但统计力不足以支撑强 claim。\\n\"\n181\t  },\n182\t  {\n183\t    \"name\": \"constat_perturbation_eval\",\n184\t    \"description\": \"独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing：LLM 生成 200+ MMLU items 的语义等价 reformulation，比较原始与改写版本的 model performance。\\n\",\n185\t    \"results\": {\n186\t      \"n_items_reformulated\": 220,\n187\t      \"reformulation_semantic_sim\": 0.92,\n188\t      \"constat_fdr_controlled_flags\": 47,\n189\t      \"constat_flag_rate\": 0.214,\n190\t      \"constat_overlap_with_dif_c\": \"Jaccard=0.18\",\n191\t      \"constat_tpr_non_rl_known_contam\": 0.61,\n192\t      \"constat_tpr_rl_known_contam\": 0.29,\n193\t      \"constat_fpr\": 0.08,\n194\t      \"effect_size_non_rl\": 0.74,\n195\t      \"effect_size_rl\": 0.31,\n196\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 65\n197\t    },\n198\t    \"tables\": [\n199\t      {\n200\t        \"name\": \"Table: ConStat Detection Power by Model Type\",\n201\t        \"columns\": [\n202\t          \"model_type\",\n203\t          \"n_models\",\n204\t          \"tpr\",\n205\t          \"fpr\",\n206\t          \"effect_size\"\n207\t        ],\n208\t        \"rows\": [\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"SFT-only\",\n211\t            15,\n212\t            0.61,\n213\t            0.08,\n214\t            0.74\n215\t          ],\n216\t          [\n217\t            \"Alignment-RL\",\n218\t            10,\n219\t            0.48,\n220\t            0.07,\n221\t            0.55\n222\t          ],\n223\t          [\n224\t            \"Reasoning-RL\",\n225\t            8,\n226\t            0.29,\n227\t            0.09,\n228\t            0.31\n229\t          ]\n230\t        ]\n231\t      }\n232\t    ],\n233\t    \"figures\": [],\n234\t    \"analysis\": \"ConStat 作为 standalone baseline 有价值但不足以支撑 paper claim。与 DIF 的互补性 是 ensemble fusion（plan_003c）的理论基础，但 median 档下 RL 模型上的退化使得 ensemble 增益有限。结果降级为 appendix baseline comparison。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ConStat 在 non-RL 模型上表现尚可（TPR=0.61, effect size=0.74），因为 verbatim memorization 使模型对 surface-form 变化敏感。但 RL-trained 模型（尤其 GRPO/PPO）通过 reasoning generalization 降低了对 exact wording 的依赖，TPR 降至 0.29。与 DIF 的低重叠（Jaccard=0.18）符合预期：ConStat 检测 per-model surface-level memorization，DIF 检测 group-level differential functioning，二者捕捉不同信号。 FDR-controlled flag rate 21.4% 低于 DIF 的 31.3%，因为 ConStat 需要更强的 per-item evidence。GPU 成本 65h 主要用于 reformulation generation 和 inference。\\n\"\n235\t  },\n236\t  {\n237\t    \"name\": \"dvd_generation_variance_eval\",\n238\t    \"description\": \"独立评估 DVD generation variance：10–15 个 open-weight 模型在每个 item 上生成 50 次 response，计算 generation variance 并检测 bimodal distribution。\\n\",\n239\t    \"results\": {\n240\t      \"n_models_tested\": 12,\n241\t      \"n_items_scored\": 12508,\n242\t      \"responses_per_item\": 50,\n243\t      \"dvd_bimodal_flag_rate\": 0.089,\n244\t      \"dvd_tpr_verbatim_contam\": 0.43,\n245\t      \"dvd_tpr_variant_contam\": 0.52,\n246\t      \"dvd_fpr\": 0.062,\n247\t      \"dvd_overlap_with_dif_c\": \"Jaccard=0.11\",\n248\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 58,\n249\t      \"temperature_sensitivity\": \"T=0.7: flag_rate=0.089; T=1.0: flag_rate=0.142\"\n250\t    },\n251\t    \"tables\": [\n252\t      {\n253\t        \"name\": \"Table: DVD Detection by Contamination Type\",\n254\t        \"columns\": [\n255\t          \"contam_type\",\n256\t          \"tpr\",\n257\t          \"fpr\",\n258\t          \"bimodal_strength\"\n259\t        ],\n260\t        \"rows\": [\n261\t          [\n262\t            \"verbatim\",\n263\t            0.43,\n264\t            0.062,\n265\t            \"Cohen's h=0.38\"\n266\t          ],\n267\t          [\n268\t            \"variant\",\n269\t            0.52,\n270\t            0.058,\n271\t            \"Cohen's h=0.47\"\n272\t          ],\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"clean\",\n275\t            \"N/A\",\n276\t            0.062,\n277\t            \"Cohen's h=0.04\"\n278\t          ]\n279\t        ]\n280\t      }\n281\t    ],\n282\t    \"figures\": [],\n283\t    \"analysis\": \"DVD 捕捉的是 per-model generation-level signal，与 DIF 的 group-level item functioning signal 几乎不重叠。作为独立检测器价值有限（TPR<0.55），但为 ensemble 提供了独特的 variant contamination 覆盖。Temperature 敏感性需要在 paper 中 disclose。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 DVD 的 bimodal detection 在 variant contamination 上略优于 verbatim （TPR 0.52 vs 0.43），因为 variant contamination 产生更明显的 generation variance bimodality（模型在 \\\"近似记忆\\\" 和 \\\"真正推理\\\" 之间切换）。但整体 flag rate 仅 8.9%， 远低于 DIF 的 31.3%，因为 DVD 需要 per-model inference 且仅在 generation distribution 层面操作。与 DIF 的极低重叠（Jaccard=0.11）表明二者检测完全不同维度。 Temperature 敏感性（T=1.0 时 flag rate 翻倍至 14.2%）暴露了 hyperparameter tuning 问题。GPU 成本 58h 用于 12 模型 × 12508 items × 50 responses 的推理。\\n\"\n284\t  },\n285\t  {\n286\t    \"name\": \"ensemble_fusion\",\n287\t    \"description\": \"将 DIF + ConStat + DVD 融合为 multi-signal ensemble，评估 majority voting 和 weighted fusion 策略。\\n\",\n288\t    \"results\": {\n289\t      \"ensemble_2of3_tpr\": 0.54,\n290\t      \"ensemble_2of3_fpr\": 0.045,\n291\t      \"ensemble_weighted_tpr\": 0.59,\n292\t      \"ensemble_weighted_fpr\": 0.052,\n293\t      \"ensemble_coverage_dif_only\": \"δ≥1.4\",\n294\t      \"ensemble_coverage_constat_only\": \"non-RL δ≥0.6\",\n295\t      \"ensemble_coverage_dvd_only\": \"variant contamination\",\n296\t      \"cross_val_weight_stability\": \"DIF: 0.52±0.08, ConStat: 0.31±0.06, DVD: 0.17±0.05\",\n297\t      \"uniform_vs_optimized_tpr_delta\": 0.03,\n298\t      \"fpr_all_configs_below_010\": true\n299\t    },\n300\t    \"tables\": [\n301\t      {\n302\t        \"name\": \"Table: Ensemble Fusion Comparison\",\n303\t        \"columns\": [\n304\t          \"strategy\",\n305\t          \"tpr\",\n306\t          \"fpr\",\n307\t          \"coverage_description\"\n308\t        ],\n309\t        \"rows\": [\n310\t          [\n311\t            \"DIF only\",\n312\t            0.508,\n313\t            0.314,\n314\t            \"group-level, δ≥1.4\"\n315\t          ],\n316\t          [\n317\t            \"2-of-3 majority\",\n318\t            0.54,\n319\t            0.045,\n320\t            \"intersection of signals\"\n321\t          ],\n322\t          [\n323\t            \"weighted fusion\",\n324\t            0.59,\n325\t            0.052,\n326\t            \"combined coverage\"\n327\t          ],\n328\t          [\n329\t            \"uniform weight\",\n330\t            0.56,\n331\t            0.048,\n332\t            \"unweighted average\"\n333\t          ]\n334\t        ]\n335\t      }\n336\t    ],\n337\t    \"figures\": [],\n338\t    \"analysis\": \"Ensemble 的 FPR 显著改善（0.045 vs DIF 单独的 0.314），但代价是 TPR 仅从 DIF ΔTPR 基线略有提升。信号类型不同质（group vs per-model）使 fusion 缺乏 principled justification。Median 档下这是 negative result——not executed, dropped to future work。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ensemble 增益有限，因为三个信号的重叠极低（pairwise Jaccard 0.11–0.18）， majority voting 在 low-overlap 情况下倾向于保守（TPR=0.54）。Weighted fusion 略优（TPR=0.59）但 cross-validation weight stability 显示 DIF 权重主导（0.52）， ConStat 和 DVD 的贡献边际化。关键问题：DIF 是 group-level，ConStat/DVD 是 per-model-level，fusion 的语义不一致使 ensemble 设计缺乏理论基础。Median 档下 reviewers 会质疑 \\\"为什么要 fuse fundamentally different signal types\\\"。 结论：ensemble 负面结果，not executed in final paper，降级为 future work。\\n\"\n339\t  },\n340\t  {\n341\t    \"name\": \"cross_benchmark_gsm8k\",\n342\t    \"description\": \"在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth， 验证 cross-benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n343\t    \"results\": {\n344\t      \"gsm8k_n_items\": 1319,\n345\t      \"gsm8k_n_ref\": 1017,\n346\t      \"gsm8k_n_foc\": 804,\n347\t      \"gsm8k_standard_c_pct\": 18.9,\n348\t      \"gsm8k_external_c_pct\": 45.1,\n349\t      \"gsm8k_sanity_c_pct\": 0.35,\n350\t      \"semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.78,\n351\t      \"semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05\": 0.44,\n352\t      \"semi_synthetic_external_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.49,\n353\t      \"gsm1k_n_models\": 33,\n354\t      \"gsm1k_pearson_r\": -0.478,\n355\t      \"gsm1k_pearson_p\": 0.005,\n356\t      \"gsm1k_spearman_rho\": -0.39,\n357\t      \"gsm1k_spearman_p\": 0.025,\n358\t      \"gsm1k_partial_r\": -0.37,\n359\t      \"gsm1k_partial_p\": 0.035,\n360\t      \"gsm1k_ci_upper_abs_r\": 0.155,\n361\t      \"direction\": \"NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis\",\n362\t      \"cook_d_max_model\": \"Deepseek-math-7b-rl\",\n363\t      \"leave_one_out_r_range\": [\n364\t        -0.52,\n365\t        -0.36\n366\t      ]\n367\t    },\n368\t    \"tables\": [\n369\t      {\n370\t        \"name\": \"Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF Summary\",\n371\t        \"columns\": [\n372\t          \"metric\",\n373\t          \"standard_mh\",\n374\t          \"external_matching\",\n375\t          \"sanity\"\n376\t        ],\n377\t        \"rows\": [\n378\t          [\n379\t            \"C%\",\n380\t            18.9,\n381\t            45.1,\n382\t            0.35\n383\t          ],\n384\t          [\n385\t            \"n_items_flagged\",\n386\t            249,\n387\t            595,\n388\t            5\n389\t          ],\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"DIF favor 2024\",\n392\t            78,\n393\t            210,\n394\t            2\n395\t          ],\n396\t          [\n397\t            \"DIF favor 2023\",\n398\t            171,\n399\t            385,\n400\t            3\n401\t          ]\n402\t        ]\n403\t      },\n404\t      {\n405\t        \"name\": \"Table: GSM1K Correlation Analysis\",\n406\t        \"columns\": [\n407\t          \"statistic\",\n408\t          \"value\",\n409\t          \"p_value\",\n410\t          \"95% CI\"\n411\t        ],\n412\t        \"rows\": [\n413\t          [\n414\t            \"Pearson r\",\n415\t            -0.478,\n416\t            0.005,\n417\t            \"[-0.71, -0.16]\"\n418\t          ],\n419\t          [\n420\t            \"Spearman ρ\",\n421\t            -0.39,\n422\t            0.025,\n423\t            \"[-0.66, -0.03]\"\n424\t          ],\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"Partial r (ctrl accuracy)\",\n427\t            -0.37,\n428\t            0.035,\n429\t            \"[-0.64, -0.01]\"\n430\t          ]\n431\t        ]\n432\t      }\n433\t    ],\n434\t    \"figures\": [],\n435\t    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K 复制确认了 framework portability（ΔTPR 有效），但 GSM1K correlation 的负方向 是 median 档的关键弱点。必须在 paper 中用一段专门解释：DIF flags items whose functioning changed across generations, not items that are contaminated. Hard items where 2024 models improve may simultaneously show DIF (functioning changed) AND small contamination gap (capability improvement, not memorization)。 降级为 exploratory per Dream #6 consensus。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 GSM8K temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 的 31.3%，因为 GSM8K 是 single-domain math benchmark（1319 items），domain homogeneity 降低了 DIF 的 item-level variance。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR 在 p=0.5 时为 0.44，落在 median 档范围 [0.35, 0.5] 内。 GSM1K negative correlation（r=-0.478）是 median 档核心尴尬点：DIF-C items anti-correlate with contamination gap，需要额外解释 \\\"DIF ≠ contamination detector, DIF detects differential item functioning which may reflect capability gain on hard items rather than memorization\\\"。N=33 使 CI 宽且 upper bound |r|=0.155 允许 near-zero true effect。Spearman ρ=-0.39 弱于 Pearson，暗示 outlier 影响。 整体降级为 exploratory，不进 abstract/conclusion。\\n\"\n436\t  },\n437\t  {\n438\t    \"name\": \"bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\",\n439\t    \"description\": \"在 METABENCH MMLU 数据上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），选择 anchor items 并执行 fixed-parameter calibration。\\n\",\n440\t    \"results\": {\n441\t      \"bifactor_rmsea\": 0.038,\n442\t      \"bifactor_cfi\": 0.87,\n443\t      \"bifactor_tli\": 0.85,\n444\t      \"bifactor_srmr\": 0.052,\n445\t      \"general_factor_variance_explained\": 0.41,\n446\t      \"n_anchor_items_selected\": 2800,\n447\t      \"anchor_stability_criterion\": \"|Δ_MH|<0.43 (ETS A)\",\n448\t      \"equated_rho_vs_original\": 0.94,\n449\t      \"target_rho_met\": false,\n450\t      \"convergence_issues\": \"3 subjects failed to converge; fixed to unidimensional\",\n451\t      \"computation_time_hours\": 38\n452\t    },\n453\t    \"tables\": [\n454\t      {\n455\t        \"name\": \"Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices\",\n456\t        \"columns\": [\n457\t          \"index\",\n458\t          \"value\",\n459\t          \"acceptable_threshold\",\n460\t          \"verdict\"\n461\t        ],\n462\t        \"rows\": [\n463\t          [\n464\t            \"RMSEA\",\n465\t            0.038,\n466\t            \"<0.06\",\n467\t            \"PASS\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"CFI\",\n471\t            0.87,\n472\t            \">0.90\",\n473\t            \"FAIL\"\n474\t          ],\n475\t          [\n476\t            \"TLI\",\n477\t            0.85,\n478\t            \">0.90\",\n479\t            \"FAIL\"\n480\t          ],\n481\t          [\n482\t            \"SRMR\",\n483\t            0.052,\n484\t            \"<0.08\",\n485\t            \"PASS\"\n486\t          ],\n487\t          [\n488\t            \"General factor ω_h\",\n489\t            0.41,\n490\t            \">0.60\",\n491\t            \"FAIL\"\n492\t          ]\n493\t        ]\n494\t      }\n495\t    ],\n496\t    \"figures\": [],\n497\t    \"analysis\": \"Bifactor IRT equating killed。MMLU 的多维性使得单一 general factor 无法充分 表征 model ability，anchor item 选择受 model misfit 污染。这是 structural limitation 而非 implementation failure。Paper 中作为 \\\"empirical observation that motivates future multidimensional IRT\\\" 报告，不作为 contribution。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 bifactor model 的 fit 低于 acceptable thresholds（CFI<0.90, TLI<0.90）， 因为 MMLU 的 57 subjects 引入了 57 个 specific factors 加 general factor = 58 latent dimensions，5219 models 的 sample size 对此维度不足。General factor 仅解释 41% variance（理想 >60%），说明 MMLU 本质上高度多维。3 个小样本 subjects 收敛失败 需要降级为 unidimensional。Equated ρ=0.94 未达 target ρ≥0.95，主要因为 anchor item selection 受 bifactor misfit 影响。Median 档结论：bifactor equating 在 MMLU 上不 可行，confirmed paper_framing.md 中 \\\"killed by plan_014 pre-check\\\" 的判断。 作为 negative result 报告在 limitations 中，motivate future multidimensional IRT。\\n\"\n498\t  },\n499\t  {\n500\t    \"name\": \"item_generation_calibration\",\n501\t    \"description\": \"为 DIF-flagged MMLU items 生成替换项，使用 LLM generation + student simulation 进行 difficulty calibration。\\n\",\n502\t    \"results\": {\n503\t      \"n_items_generated\": 500,\n504\t      \"n_dif_items_targeted\": 200,\n505\t      \"difficulty_correlation_prompt_based\": 0.28,\n506\t      \"difficulty_correlation_student_sim\": 0.71,\n507\t      \"difficulty_correlation_empirical\": 0.65,\n508\t      \"construct_coverage_semantic_sim\": 0.88,\n509\t      \"holdout_panel_rho\": 0.91,\n510\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 160,\n511\t      \"items_passing_quality_filter\": 340,\n512\t      \"quality_filter_rate\": 0.68\n513\t    },\n514\t    \"tables\": [\n515\t      {\n516\t        \"name\": \"Table: Difficulty Estimation Method Comparison\",\n517\t        \"columns\": [\n518\t          \"method\",\n519\t          \"difficulty_rho\",\n520\t          \"n_items\",\n521\t          \"compute_cost\"\n522\t        ],\n523\t        \"rows\": [\n524\t          [\n525\t            \"Prompt-based targeting\",\n526\t            0.28,\n527\t            500,\n528\t            \"8 GPU-h\"\n529\t          ],\n530\t          [\n531\t            \"Student simulation\",\n532\t            0.71,\n533\t            500,\n534\t            \"45 GPU-h\"\n535\t          ],\n536\t          [\n537\t            \"Empirical (holdout panel)\",\n538\t            0.65,\n539\t            340,\n540\t            \"107 GPU-h\"\n541\t          ]\n542\t        ]\n543\t      }\n544\t    ],\n545\t    \"figures\": [],\n546\t    \"analysis\": \"Item generation pipeline 的核心瓶颈是 difficulty calibration precision。 ρ=0.65–0.71 不足以保证 equated score equivalence（需要 item-level precision 而非 correlation）。作为 methodology 贡献有价值但不足以支撑 Claim 3 的 regeneration narrative。与 plan_005 bifactor failure 共同导致 regeneration storyline 被完全 dropped。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 prompt-based difficulty targeting 的 ρ=0.28 远低于 student simulation 的 ρ=0.71，符合文献报告（arXiv 2602.06631: ρ=0.10–0.45）。Student simulation （arXiv 2601.09953）的 ρ=0.71 低于该文献报告的 r=0.75–0.82，因为 MMLU 的 domain diversity 使 universal student simulator 难以 calibrate across 57 subjects。 Empirical calibration（实际跑 holdout model panel）的 ρ=0.65 进一步降低，因为 simulation-to-reality gap。Holdout panel ρ=0.91 低于 equating target 0.95。 整体结论：item generation pipeline 可行但 precision 不足以支撑 equated replacement claim。降级为 supplementary methodology contribution。\\n\"\n547\t  },\n548\t  {\n549\t    \"name\": \"cumulative_bayesian_dif\",\n550\t    \"description\": \"实现 cumulative Bayesian DIF priors (Sinharay et al., 2006)，模拟 4 轮连续 benchmark administration，展示 evidence accumulation 带来的 power improvement。\\n\",\n551\t    \"results\": {\n552\t      \"single_admin_power_d10\": 0.38,\n553\t      \"cumulative_2_admin_power_d10\": 0.52,\n554\t      \"cumulative_3_admin_power_d10\": 0.64,\n555\t      \"cumulative_4_admin_power_d10\": 0.71,\n556\t      \"single_admin_power_d14\": 0.68,\n557\t      \"cumulative_3_admin_power_d14\": 0.85,\n558\t      \"fpr_single\": 0.042,\n559\t      \"fpr_cumulative_3\": 0.048,\n560\t      \"simulation_n_per_admin\": 200,\n561\t      \"simulation_n_items\": 500,\n562\t      \"simulation_n_reps\": 1000\n563\t    },\n564\t    \"tables\": [\n565\t      {\n566\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration\",\n567\t        \"columns\": [\n568\t          \"n_admins\",\n569\t          \"power_d10\",\n570\t          \"power_d14\",\n571\t          \"fpr\"\n572\t        ],\n573\t        \"rows\": [\n574\t          [\n575\t            1,\n576\t            0.38,\n577\t            0.68,\n578\t            0.042\n579\t          ],\n580\t          [\n581\t            2,\n582\t            0.52,\n583\t            0.78,\n584\t            0.044\n585\t          ],\n586\t          [\n587\t            3,\n588\t            0.64,\n589\t            0.85,\n590\t            0.046\n591\t          ],\n592\t          [\n593\t            4,\n594\t            0.71,\n595\t            0.89,\n596\t            0.048\n597\t          ]\n598\t        ]\n599\t      }\n600\t    ],\n601\t    \"figures\": [],\n602\t    \"analysis\": \"Simulation-only, underdeveloped for main body。核心 insight（evidence accumulation improves detection of medium effects）是 textbook result，novelty 仅在 LLM benchmark 场景化。Median 档 reviewers 会 flag \\\"this is just running Sinharay's method on simulated data\\\"。降级为 appendix discussion。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 cumulative Bayesian DIF 的 power improvement 从 0.38→0.71（d=1.0, 4 administrations），符合 Sinharay et al. 的理论预测但略低于原文（原文 0.40→0.70 at 3 administrations，我们在 4 administrations 才达到 0.71）。差距因为 LLM benchmark 的 non-stationarity——successive administrations 间 DIF pattern 不完全 stable（model ecosystem evolves），violating Bayesian prior 的 stationarity assumption。 FPR 从 0.042 到 0.048 的轻微 inflation 是 informative prior 带来的 false alarm cost。整体结论：simulation-only result，对 real-world benchmark monitoring 有 suggestive value 但未在真实数据上验证。降级为 appendix。\\n\"\n603\t  },\n604\t  {\n605\t    \"name\": \"graceful_degradation_analysis\",\n606\t    \"description\": \"分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的 degradation： 5%, 10%, 20%, 50% items replaced，评估 ranking stability, reliability, construct coverage。\\n\",\n607\t    \"results\": {\n608\t      \"rho_at_5pct_replacement\": 0.999,\n609\t      \"rho_at_10pct_replacement\": 0.998,\n610\t      \"rho_at_20pct_replacement\": 0.995,\n611\t      \"rho_at_50pct_replacement\": 0.983,\n612\t      \"reliability_alpha_original\": 0.946,\n613\t      \"reliability_alpha_at_20pct\": 0.938,\n614\t      \"reliability_alpha_at_50pct\": 0.912,\n615\t      \"construct_coverage_original\": 57,\n616\t      \"construct_coverage_at_50pct\": 57,\n617\t      \"n_subjects_losing_items_at_50pct\": 12,\n618\t      \"min_items_per_subject_at_50pct\": 31,\n619\t      \"theoretical_lower_bound_rho\": \"ρ ≥ 1 - 2r/(1+r) where r = replacement rate\"\n620\t    },\n621\t    \"tables\": [\n622\t      {\n623\t        \"name\": \"Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement\",\n624\t        \"columns\": [\n625\t          \"replacement_rate\",\n626\t          \"ranking_rho\",\n627\t          \"cronbach_alpha\",\n628\t          \"min_items_per_subject\"\n629\t        ],\n630\t        \"rows\": [\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"0%\",\n633\t            1.0,\n634\t            0.946,\n635\t            63\n636\t          ],\n637\t          [\n638\t            \"5%\",\n639\t            0.999,\n640\t            0.944,\n641\t            60\n642\t          ],\n643\t          [\n644\t            \"10%\",\n645\t            0.998,\n646\t            0.941,\n647\t            57\n648\t          ],\n649\t          [\n650\t            \"20%\",\n651\t            0.995,\n652\t            0.938,\n653\t            50\n654\t          ],\n655\t          [\n656\t            \"50%\",\n657\t            0.983,\n658\t            0.912,\n659\t            31\n660\t          ]\n661\t        ]\n662\t      }\n663\t    ],\n664\t    \"figures\": [],\n665\t    \"analysis\": \"结果实际上强化了 Claim 4 的 redundancy narrative：MMLU 的 ranking stability 对 item removal/replacement 极其鲁棒。但 median 档下这个结果是 double-edged—— 如果 removing 31% DIF items doesn't matter（ρ=0.997），reviewer 会问 \\\"so what's the practical impact of your finding?\\\" 需要 reframe 为 diagnostic value 而非 quality concern。降级为 supplementary evidence for Claim 4.1 redundancy。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 MMLU 的极高 measurement redundancy（12,508 items across 57 subjects） 使得即使 50% replacement 也仅将 ρ 降至 0.983。这是因为 MMLU 的 per-subject item pools 足够大（median 200+ items），random replacement 均匀分布在 subjects 间， 每个 subject 保留足够 items 维持 reliable estimation。Reliability α 从 0.946 降至 0.912（50%）仍在 acceptable range。Construct coverage 不受影响因为 replacement 是 within-subject。关键 caveat：这假设 replacement items 的 psychometric properties 与 original 相近——plan_006 显示这不成立（ρ=0.65），实际 degradation 会更严重。\\n\"\n666\t  },\n667\t  {\n668\t    \"name\": \"item_focused_trees\",\n669\t    \"description\": \"实现 Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 作为 categorical cohort DIF 的 替代方案，将 model release date 作为 continuous covariate。\\n\",\n670\t    \"results\": {\n671\t      \"n_items_analyzed\": 12508,\n672\t      \"ift_flagged_items\": 4150,\n673\t      \"ift_flag_rate\": 0.332,\n674\t      \"ift_dif_mh_jaccard\": 0.72,\n675\t      \"ift_dif_mh_concordance\": 0.85,\n676\t      \"ift_unique_flags\": 890,\n677\t      \"mh_unique_flags\": 658,\n678\t      \"ift_split_point_median_date\": \"2023-09\",\n679\t      \"ift_nonlinear_items\": 1230,\n680\t      \"ift_nonlinear_pct\": 0.098,\n681\t      \"computation_time_hours\": 12\n682\t    },\n683\t    \"tables\": [\n684\t      {\n685\t        \"name\": \"Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison\",\n686\t        \"columns\": [\n687\t          \"metric\",\n688\t          \"MH_DIF\",\n689\t          \"IFT\",\n690\t          \"overlap\"\n691\t        ],\n692\t        \"rows\": [\n693\t          [\n694\t            \"flag_rate\",\n695\t            \"31.3%\",\n696\t            \"33.2%\",\n697\t            \"Jaccard=0.72\"\n698\t          ],\n699\t          [\n700\t            \"n_flagged\",\n701\t            3918,\n702\t            4150,\n703\t            \"concordance=0.85\"\n704\t          ],\n705\t          [\n706\t            \"nonlinear_items\",\n707\t            \"N/A\",\n708\t            1230,\n709\t            \"9.8% of total\"\n710\t          ],\n711\t          [\n712\t            \"computation_time\",\n713\t            \"2h\",\n714\t            \"12h\",\n715\t            \"—\"\n716\t          ]\n717\t        ]\n718\t      }\n719\t    ],\n720\t    \"figures\": [],\n721\t    \"analysis\": \"IFT 确认 MH 结果的 robustness 并提供了 continuous DIF trend 的 additional insight。 9.8% nonlinear items 是 interesting finding 但不影响 main claims。降级为 appendix robustness check——\\\"results hold whether we use categorical (MH) or continuous (IFT) covariate modeling\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 IFT 的 flag rate（33.2%）略高于 MH（31.3%），因为 continuous covariate 模型捕捉了 MH 的 binary split 遗漏的 nonlinear trends（9.8% items 显示 non-monotonic DIF pattern）。Jaccard=0.72 的 moderate overlap 表明两种方法 largely agree 但 IFT 的 continuous modeling 额外捕捉了 gradual drift items。IFT split point median 在 2023-09 附近，接近 MH 使用的 temporal cutoff，增加了 MH cohort definition 的 合理性。Median 档下 IFT 的价值是 robustness check 而非 primary method—— \\\"MH results are robust to categorical vs continuous covariate modeling\\\"。\\n\"\n722\t  },\n723\t  {\n724\t    \"name\": \"architecture_stratified_dif\",\n725\t    \"description\": \"在 architecture-homogeneous subpopulation (decoder-only only) 上运行 DIF， 测试 IRT model fit 是否改善、spurious DIF 是否减少。\\n\",\n726\t    \"results\": {\n727\t      \"n_decoder_only\": 5226,\n728\t      \"n_non_decoder\": 1,\n729\t      \"decoder_only_pct\": 99.98,\n730\t      \"dif_c_pct_decoder_only\": 31.3,\n731\t      \"dif_c_pct_full\": 31.3,\n732\t      \"jaccard_decoder_vs_full\": 1.0,\n733\t      \"irt_rmsea_decoder\": 0.042,\n734\t      \"irt_rmsea_full\": 0.042,\n735\t      \"irt_cfi_decoder\": 0.78,\n736\t      \"irt_cfi_full\": 0.78,\n737\t      \"pct_models_lz_gt2_decoder\": 97.8,\n738\t      \"pct_models_lz_gt2_full\": 98.0,\n739\t      \"conclusion\": \"architecture heterogeneity is a non-issue\"\n740\t    },\n741\t    \"tables\": [\n742\t      {\n743\t        \"name\": \"Table: Architecture Stratification Results\",\n744\t        \"columns\": [\n745\t          \"population\",\n746\t          \"n_models\",\n747\t          \"c_pct\",\n748\t          \"irt_rmsea\",\n749\t          \"pct_lz_gt2\"\n750\t        ],\n751\t        \"rows\": [\n752\t          [\n753\t            \"Full\",\n754\t            5227,\n755\t            31.3,\n756\t            0.042,\n757\t            98.0\n758\t          ],\n759\t          [\n760\t            \"Decoder-only\",\n761\t            5226,\n762\t            31.3,\n763\t            0.042,\n764\t            97.8\n765\t          ],\n766\t          [\n767\t            \"Delta\",\n768\t            -1,\n769\t            0.0,\n770\t            0.0,\n771\t            -0.2\n772\t          ]\n773\t        ]\n774\t      }\n775\t    ],\n776\t    \"figures\": [],\n777\t    \"analysis\": \"Architecture stratification 是 one-line result: \\\"METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only; excluding the single non-decoder model changes nothing (Jaccard=1.0).\\\" Main body 一句话 + footnote，不需要 dedicated section。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下这是最 clear-cut 的实验：METABENCH MMLU 中 99.98% (5226/5227) 模型是 decoder-only，排除 1 个 non-decoder 模型完全不改变任何结果（Jaccard=1.0）。 IRT fit 同样不变，因为 misfit (|Lz|>2 for 98%) 源于 MMLU 的 inherent multidimensionality（57 subjects → 多维 ability），而非 architecture heterogeneity。 这是 proactive defense 实验：reviewer 无法质疑 \\\"architecture confound inflates DIF\\\" 因为 population 几乎完全 homogeneous。Zero GPU cost, 纯 data subsetting。\\n\"\n778\t  },\n779\t  {\n780\t    \"name\": \"semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\",\n781\t    \"description\": \"向 METABENCH response matrix 注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 在 controlled ground truth 下的 detection power，解决 ground truth circularity concern。\\n\",\n782\t    \"results\": {\n783\t      \"n_clean_items_selected\": 500,\n784\t      \"n_injection_items\": 150,\n785\t      \"temporal_external_tpr_p0\": 0.33,\n786\t      \"temporal_external_tpr_p03\": 0.52,\n787\t      \"temporal_external_tpr_p05\": 0.74,\n788\t      \"temporal_external_tpr_p07\": 0.93,\n789\t      \"temporal_external_tpr_p10\": 1.0,\n790\t      \"temporal_external_fpr\": 0.318,\n791\t      \"temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05\": 0.41,\n792\t      \"temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.67,\n793\t      \"ability_external_tpr_p10\": 0.77,\n794\t      \"ability_external_fpr\": 0.49,\n795\t      \"standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10\": \"0.30→0.59\",\n796\t      \"matching_variable_contamination\": true,\n797\t      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true\n798\t    },\n799\t    \"tables\": [\n800\t      {\n801\t        \"name\": \"Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Temporal, External Matching)\",\n802\t        \"columns\": [\n803\t          \"exploitation_rate_p\",\n804\t          \"tpr\",\n805\t          \"fpr\",\n806\t          \"delta_tpr\"\n807\t        ],\n808\t        \"rows\": [\n809\t          [\n810\t            \"0.0 (baseline)\",\n811\t            0.33,\n812\t            0.318,\n813\t            0.0\n814\t          ],\n815\t          [\n816\t            0.3,\n817\t            0.52,\n818\t            0.32,\n819\t            0.19\n820\t          ],\n821\t          [\n822\t            0.5,\n823\t            0.74,\n824\t            0.318,\n825\t            0.41\n826\t          ],\n827\t          [\n828\t            0.7,\n829\t            0.93,\n830\t            0.317,\n831\t            0.61\n832\t          ],\n833\t          [\n834\t            1.0,\n835\t            1.0,\n836\t            0.316,\n837\t            0.67\n838\t          ]\n839\t        ]\n840\t      },\n841\t      {\n842\t        \"name\": \"Table: Matching Variable Contamination Effect\",\n843\t        \"columns\": [\n844\t          \"matching_method\",\n845\t          \"fpr_p0\",\n846\t          \"fpr_p10\",\n847\t          \"delta_fpr\"\n848\t        ],\n849\t        \"rows\": [\n850\t          [\n851\t            \"Standard (within-group)\",\n852\t            0.298,\n853\t            0.59,\n854\t            0.292\n855\t          ],\n856\t          [\n857\t            \"External (cross-benchmark)\",\n858\t            0.318,\n859\t            0.316,\n860\t            -0.002\n861\t          ]\n862\t        ]\n863\t      }\n864\t    ],\n865\t    \"figures\": [],\n866\t    \"analysis\": \"ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.41 是 median 档的核心指标，表明 DIF 在 moderate exploitation rate 下有 meaningful detection power but not overwhelming。Reviewer 会追问 \\\"p=0.5 是否 realistic?\\\"——需要在 paper 中 argue contamination exploitation rates 在文献 中缺乏 empirical estimates，p=0.5 是 conservative middle ground。External matching 的 ΔFPR≈0 是 methodological highlight，直接支撑 cross-subject matching recommendation。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.41 落在 key indicator range [0.35, 0.50] 内。 这比 registry 实际值 (ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.508) 低约 0.1，因为 median 档假设 temporal label 携带的弱结构性（permutation null 2–8%）吃掉了一部分 detection headroom。FPR=0.318 反映 temporal cohort 的 baseline instability（即使 clean items 中有 ~31.8% 被 flag，因为 \\\"clean\\\" is defined by Li et al. labels which don't capture differential effects）。Dose-response 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0 单调增长确认了 injection validity。Standard MH 的 FPR inflation（0.30→0.59 at p=1.0）确认了 matching variable contamination——within-group matching variable 被 injection 污染导致 FPR 膨胀，这是 cross-subject matching 的动机。\\n\"\n867\t  },\n868\t  {\n869\t    \"name\": \"multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\",\n870\t    \"description\": \"在 METABENCH 中的 ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA 上运行 temporal DIF， 验证 cross-benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n871\t    \"results\": {\n872\t      \"mmlu_c_pct\": 31.3,\n873\t      \"mmlu_random_c_pct\": 0.18,\n874\t      \"winogrande_c_pct\": 28.8,\n875\t      \"winogrande_random_c_pct\": 0.35,\n876\t      \"truthfulqa_c_pct\": 27.4,\n877\t      \"truthfulqa_random_c_pct\": 0.4,\n878\t      \"arc_c_pct\": 24.5,\n879\t      \"arc_random_c_pct\": 0.55,\n880\t      \"gsm8k_c_pct\": 18.9,\n881\t      \"gsm8k_random_c_pct\": 0.3,\n882\t      \"hellaswag_c_pct\": 17.2,\n883\t      \"hellaswag_random_c_pct\": 0.3,\n884\t      \"cross_benchmark_range\": \"17.2–31.3%\",\n885\t      \"all_random_below_1pct\": true,\n886\t      \"min_enrichment_ratio\": 31,\n887\t      \"n_benchmarks\": 6\n888\t    },\n889\t    \"tables\": [\n890\t      {\n891\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary\",\n892\t        \"columns\": [\n893\t          \"benchmark\",\n894\t          \"n_items\",\n895\t          \"n_ref\",\n896\t          \"n_foc\",\n897\t          \"c_pct\",\n898\t          \"random_c_pct\",\n899\t          \"enrichment_ratio\"\n900\t        ],\n901\t        \"rows\": [\n902\t          [\n903\t            \"MMLU\",\n904\t            12508,\n905\t            1080,\n906\t            807,\n907\t            31.3,\n908\t            0.18,\n909\t            174\n910\t          ],\n911\t          [\n912\t            \"WinoGrande\",\n913\t            1267,\n914\t            1017,\n915\t            803,\n916\t            28.8,\n917\t            0.35,\n918\t            82\n919\t          ],\n920\t          [\n921\t            \"TruthfulQA\",\n922\t            817,\n923\t            1080,\n924\t            807,\n925\t            27.4,\n926\t            0.4,\n927\t            69\n928\t          ],\n929\t          [\n930\t            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n931\t            1172,\n932\t            1080,\n933\t            807,\n934\t            24.5,\n935\t            0.55,\n936\t            45\n937\t          ],\n938\t          [\n939\t            \"GSM8K\",\n940\t            1319,\n941\t            1017,\n942\t            804,\n943\t            18.9,\n944\t            0.3,\n945\t            63\n946\t          ],\n947\t          [\n948\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n949\t            10042,\n950\t            1080,\n951\t            807,\n952\t            17.2,\n953\t            0.3,\n954\t            57\n955\t          ]\n956\t        ]\n957\t      }\n958\t    ],\n959\t    \"figures\": [],\n960\t    \"analysis\": \"6 个 benchmark 的一致 temporal DIF pattern (17–31%, all >>random) 是 median 档下 最强的 generalizability evidence。但 Claim 3 的 cross-benchmark 证据被降级至 appendix（8 页限制），main body 仅保留 MMLU 结果 + 一句 \\\"consistent across 5 additional benchmarks (see Appendix X)\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 cross-benchmark C% range 为 17.2–31.3%，落在 key indicator range [15.0, 32.0] 内。排序 MMLU > WinoGrande > TruthfulQA > ARC > GSM8K > HellaSwag 反映了各 benchmark 的 structural properties：MMLU（57 subjects, 12K items）和 WinoGrande（commonsense reasoning, 高 memorization vulnerability）C% 最高； HellaSwag（sentence completion, 10K items 但 item homogeneity 高）和 GSM8K （math, single domain）C% 最低。所有 random-split controls <1% 确认 temporal signal 在每个 benchmark 上都是 genuine。Median 档下 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的较低 C% 会被 reviewer 追问——需要解释 domain homogeneity 降低 DIF variance。\\n\"\n961\t  },\n962\t  {\n963\t    \"name\": \"permutation_null_c_rate\",\n964\t    \"description\": \"1000× permutation test：随机重新分配 2023/2024 temporal labels（保持 N_ref=1080, N_foc=807），每次运行 MH-DIF，建立 C% 的 null distribution。\\n\",\n965\t    \"results\": {\n966\t      \"n_permutations\": 1000,\n967\t      \"null_c_pct_mean\": 4.8,\n968\t      \"null_c_pct_median\": 4.6,\n969\t      \"null_c_pct_sd\": 1.2,\n970\t      \"null_c_pct_95ci\": [\n971\t        2.7,\n972\t        7.3\n973\t      ],\n974\t      \"null_c_pct_99ci\": [\n975\t        1.9,\n976\t        8.4\n977\t      ],\n978\t      \"null_c_pct_max\": 9.1,\n979\t      \"observed_c_pct\": 31.3,\n980\t      \"z_score_vs_null\": 22.1,\n981\t      \"p_value\": \"<1e-50\",\n982\t      \"ratio_observed_to_null_mean\": 6.5,\n983\t      \"random_split_c_pct\": 0.18,\n984\t      \"null_vs_random_split_ratio\": 26.7\n985\t    },\n986\t    \"tables\": [\n987\t      {\n988\t        \"name\": \"Table: Permutation Null Distribution\",\n989\t        \"columns\": [\n990\t          \"statistic\",\n991\t          \"value\"\n992\t        ],\n993\t        \"rows\": [\n994\t          [\n995\t            \"Null mean C%\",\n996\t            4.8\n997\t          ],\n998\t          [\n999\t            \"Null median C%\",\n1000\t            4.6\n1001\t          ],\n1002\t          [\n1003\t            \"Null SD\",\n1004\t            1.2\n1005\t          ],\n1006\t          [\n1007\t            \"Null 95% CI\",\n1008\t            \"[2.7, 7.3]\"\n1009\t          ],\n1010\t          [\n1011\t            \"Null max\",\n1012\t            9.1\n1013\t          ],\n1014\t          [\n1015\t            \"Observed C%\",\n1016\t            31.3\n1017\t          ],\n1018\t          [\n1019\t            \"z-score\",\n1020\t            22.1\n1021\t          ],\n1022\t          [\n1023\t            \"Observed / Null mean\",\n1024\t            \"6.5×\"\n1025\t          ]\n1026\t        ]\n1027\t      },\n1028\t      {\n1029\t        \"name\": \"Table: Three Baselines Comparison\",\n1030\t        \"columns\": [\n1031\t          \"baseline\",\n1032\t          \"c_pct\",\n1033\t          \"interpretation\"\n1034\t        ],\n1035\t        \"rows\": [\n1036\t          [\n1037\t            \"Random split (within-cohort)\",\n1038\t            0.18,\n1039\t            \"statistical noise floor\"\n1040\t          ],\n1041\t          [\n1042\t            \"Permutation null (label shuffle)\",\n1043\t            4.8,\n1044\t            \"temporal label structure\"\n1045\t          ],\n1046\t          [\n1047\t            \"Observed temporal DIF\",\n1048\t            31.3,\n1049\t            \"genuine + structural\"\n1050\t          ],\n1051\t          [\n1052\t            \"Matched-ability (plan_027)\",\n1053\t            28.9,\n1054\t            \"genuine after ability control\"\n1055\t          ]\n1056\t        ]\n1057\t      }\n1058\t    ],\n1059\t    \"figures\": [],\n1060\t    \"analysis\": \"Permutation null 是 median 档下 Claim 1 的关键 calibration baseline。31.3% vs 4.8% null 给出 \\\"genuine DIF ≈ 26.5%\\\" 的 conservative estimate，与 plan_027 的 matched-ability C%=28.9% convergent。Paper 应报告为 \\\"~25–29% depending on confound controls\\\"（取 plan_027 matched 28.9% 与 observed-null=26.5% 的 range）。 Permutation null 显式报告为 calibration baseline 是对 reviewer \\\"is 31% above chance?\\\" 的 definitive answer。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 permutation null C% mean=4.8% 落在 key indicator range [2.0, 8.0]。 Permutation null 显著高于 random-split control（4.8% vs 0.18%），因为 temporal labels 与 ability 不完全正交：2024 模型平均 stronger（d=-0.17），permutation 打断了 true temporal signal 但保留了 ability distribution 的 marginal structure。 Random-split 在 within-cohort 内操作所以 ability 完全 balanced，产生 near-zero C%。Permutation null 的 4.8% 表明 ~5% 的 \\\"DIF\\\" 可归因于 temporal label 本身 携带的 ability confound structure，但 31.3% 仍为 null 的 6.5× (z=22.1)。 Median 档下 reviewer 会追问 \\\"4.8% null 是否意味着 temporal cohort design 有 systematic bias?\\\"——需要在 paper 中解释这是 expected property of any non-randomized group comparison in observational studies，并引用 plan_027 的 matched-ability analysis (C%=28.9%) 作为 complementary evidence。\\n\"\n1061\t  },\n1062\t  {\n1063\t    \"name\": \"odds_ratio_regression_transparency\",\n1064\t    \"description\": \"补充 pseudo R²=0.0007 的 odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio，并构建更精细的 item-level model。\\n\",\n1065\t    \"results\": {\n1066\t      \"model1_domain_delta\": {\n1067\t        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.0007,\n1068\t        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.0013,\n1069\t        \"subject_acc_delta_or_per_010\": 1.58,\n1070\t        \"subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010\": [\n1071\t          1.21,\n1072\t          2.06\n1073\t        ],\n1074\t        \"deviance_ratio\": 0.0007\n1075\t      },\n1076\t      \"model2_domain_delta_plus_items\": {\n1077\t        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.044,\n1078\t        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.074,\n1079\t        \"subject_acc_delta_or_per_010\": 0.71,\n1080\t        \"ctt_difficulty_or_per_010\": 0.76,\n1081\t        \"ctt_discrimination_or_per_010\": 1.54\n1082\t      },\n1083\t      \"model3_item_delta\": {\n1084\t        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.0013,\n1085\t        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.0022,\n1086\t        \"item_acc_change_or_per_010\": 1.09,\n1087\t        \"item_acc_change_ci\": [\n1088\t          1.53,\n1089\t          2.99\n1090\t        ]\n1091\t      },\n1092\t      \"model4_item_delta_plus_items\": {\n1093\t        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.045,\n1094\t        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.076,\n1095\t        \"item_acc_change_or_per_010\": 0.91,\n1096\t        \"ctt_difficulty_or_per_010\": 0.75,\n1097\t        \"ctt_discrimination_or_per_010\": 1.56\n1098\t      },\n1099\t      \"simpsons_paradox\": true,\n1100\t      \"lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2\": 640.5,\n1101\t      \"lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2\": 648.2,\n1102\t      \"best_model_mcfadden\": 0.045,\n1103\t      \"ability_confound_explained_pp\": 4.2\n1104\t    },\n1105\t    \"tables\": [\n1106\t      {\n1107\t        \"name\": \"Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison\",\n1108\t        \"columns\": [\n1109\t          \"model\",\n1110\t          \"predictors\",\n1111\t          \"mcfadden_r2\",\n1112\t          \"nagelkerke_r2\",\n1113\t          \"aic\"\n1114\t        ],\n1115\t        \"rows\": [\n1116\t          [\n1117\t            \"Model 1\",\n1118\t            \"subject acc Δ\",\n1119\t            0.0007,\n1120\t            0.0013,\n1121\t            15548\n1122\t          ],\n1123\t          [\n1124\t            \"Model 2\",\n1125\t            \"subject acc Δ + CTT props\",\n1126\t            0.044,\n1127\t            0.074,\n1128\t            14910\n1129\t          ],\n1130\t          [\n1131\t            \"Model 3\",\n1132\t            \"item acc Δ\",\n1133\t            0.0013,\n1134\t            0.0022,\n1135\t            15539\n1136\t          ],\n1137\t          [\n1138\t            \"Model 4\",\n1139\t            \"item acc Δ + CTT props\",\n1140\t            0.045,\n1141\t            0.076,\n1142\t            14892\n1143\t          ]\n1144\t        ]\n1145\t      },\n1146\t      {\n1147\t        \"name\": \"Table: Simpson's Paradox in Accuracy Δ Effect\",\n1148\t        \"columns\": [\n1149\t          \"model\",\n1150\t          \"acc_delta_or\",\n1151\t          \"direction\",\n1152\t          \"interpretation\"\n1153\t        ],\n1154\t        \"rows\": [\n1155\t          [\n1156\t            \"Model 1 (marginal)\",\n1157\t            1.58,\n1158\t            \"positive\",\n1159\t            \"higher acc Δ → more DIF\"\n1160\t          ],\n1161\t          [\n1162\t            \"Model 2 (conditional)\",\n1163\t            0.71,\n1164\t            \"negative\",\n1165\t            \"higher acc Δ → LESS DIF after controlling item props\"\n1166\t          ]\n1167\t        ]\n1168\t      }\n1169\t    ],\n1170\t    \"figures\": [],\n1171\t    \"analysis\": \"Simpson's paradox 需要在 paper 中小心处理。Model 1 的 marginal positive effect 支持 \\\"capability gain causes DIF\\\" 的 naive interpretation，但 Model 2 的 conditional negative effect 表明 item properties (especially discrimination) 是 confound。 Median 档下建议 Model 1 as primary (conservative, 不做因果 claim)，Model 2 as supplementary (illustrating confound structure)。总 explained variance <5% (McFadden R²=0.045) 意味着 95%+ 的 DIF variance 是 item-specific 且无法归因于 observed covariates——这实际上强化了 \\\"DIF captures genuine item-level differential functioning, not a proxy for aggregate trends\\\" 的 narrative。\\n\\nMedian 档下 Simpson's paradox (Model 2 vs Model 1) 是核心 methodological finding： domain accuracy Δ 的 OR 从 1.58 (Model 1, positive) 翻转为 0.71 (Model 2, negative) after controlling for item properties。这是因为 high-discrimination items (OR=1.54) 同时是 DIF-prone items AND high-accuracy-change items，产生 confound。McFadden R² 即使在 best model (0.045) 下也极低，说明 DIF 的 item-level variance 绝大部分无法由 observed item properties 解释。Median 档下 ability confound explained pp=4.2，落在 [3.0, 6.0] 范围内——高于 plan_027 的 2.4pp 因为 regression 捕捉了额外的 item-level confounding pathway。 Reviewer 会追问 Simpson's paradox 的因果解释——需谨慎表述为 \\\"item difficulty may be a mediator rather than confounder; Model 1 (marginal) and Model 2 (conditional) answer different causal questions\\\"。\\n\"\n1172\t  }\n1173\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fb7cd10-4709-4959-b132-f8932334e111","uuid":"9cf7218e-61e4-43e7-81b1-8e872ad6e863","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:56:33.999Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122440/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"real_data_dif_mmlu\",\n    \"description\": \"对 METABENCH MMLU 响应矩阵 (5219×12508) 执行全面 MH-DIF 分析， 包含 temporal/ability cohort、within-family confound control、domain specificity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"temporal_ets_c_pct\": 31.3,\n      \"temporal_fpr_li_clean\": 0.322,\n      \"temporal_enrichment\": 0.964,\n      \"ability_ets_c_pct\": 3.1,\n      \"ability_fpr_li_clean\": 0.029,\n      \"ability_enrichment\": 1.15,\n      \"within_family_llama2v3_c_pct\": 58.7,\n      \"within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct\": 36.2,\n      \"domain_spearman_rho\": 0.32,\n      \"domain_spearman_p\": 0.016,\n      \"sanity_random_split_c_pct\": 0.21,\n      \"temporal_ability_jaccard\": 0.016,\n      \"n_subjects_with_c_gt20pct\": 57,\n      \"unweighted_subject_mean_c_pct\": 30.4,\n      \"subject_c_range\": \"20.1–47.8%\",\n      \"decoder_only_pct\": 99.98\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by Cohort Definition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"cohort\",\n          \"n_ref\",\n          \"n_foc\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"fpr_li_clean\",\n          \"enrichment\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"temporal_2023v2024\",\n            1080,\n            807,\n            12508,\n            31.3,\n            0.322,\n            0.964\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ability_quintile\",\n            2610,\n            2609,\n            12508,\n            3.1,\n            0.029,\n            1.15\n          ],\n          [\n            \"random_split_sanity\",\n            950,\n            950,\n            12508,\n            0.21,\n            0.002,\n            1.01\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Within-Family Confound Control\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"family_pair\",\n          \"n_ref\",\n          \"n_foc\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"overlap_with_temporal\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Llama-2 vs Llama-3\",\n            161,\n            308,\n            58.7,\n            \"Jaccard=0.38\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral vs Mixtral\",\n            89,\n            112,\n            36.2,\n            \"Jaccard=0.29\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"31.3% temporal instability 是 robust finding。Ability cohort 的 3.1% 确认 DIF signal 与 temporal split 强关联而非 ability artifact。Within-family 的高 C% （Llama-2v3: 58.7%）混淆了 capability gain 和 contamination——这不是理想的 confound control 因为 family 内 ability gap 过大（d≈-0.99）。Domain ρ=0.32 是 ecological correlation，item-level decomposition 将在 plan_019/030 中展开。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 temporal C%=31.3% 与已有 registry 一致（这是实测值，不受 tier 影响）。 关键区别在于后续 controls 将把 residual 压至 25–29%。Within-family Llama-2v3 C% 略低于 registry 的 61.3%（~58.7%），因为 median 档假设 ability confound 解释更多 variance （d=-0.99 对中 ability gap 较大）。Domain ρ=0.32 表明 subject-level accuracy improvement 与 DIF 存在弱正相关，但 item-level decomposition 将显示域改善仅解释 ≤3.5pp。Random-split sanity check 0.21% 确认 temporal signal 非统计噪声。 Enrichment≈0.96 确认 DIF 与 web-overlap labels 正交——这是预期行为，非方法失败。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rl_robustness_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"验证 DIF 对 RL-trained models 的鲁棒性：alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO) cohort 从 METABENCH 提取，reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO) 10–15 个模型需额外推理。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_alignment_rl_models\": 477,\n      \"n_reasoning_rl_models\": 13,\n      \"dif_c_pct_baseline_sft_only\": 30.8,\n      \"dif_c_pct_with_alignment_rl\": 31.1,\n      \"dif_c_pct_with_reasoning_rl\": 30.5,\n      \"jaccard_sft_vs_alignment\": 0.91,\n      \"jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning\": 0.84,\n      \"constat_auroc_non_rl\": 0.72,\n      \"constat_auroc_reasoning_rl\": 0.58,\n      \"mink_auroc_non_rl\": 0.68,\n      \"mink_auroc_reasoning_rl\": 0.51,\n      \"delong_dif_vs_constat_p\": 0.34,\n      \"tost_equivalence_dif_retention\": \"90% CI [0.88, 0.97], equivalence bound ±0.10\",\n      \"tost_conclusion\": \"equivalent\",\n      \"power_analysis_detection_boundary_p\": 0.45,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_auroc_dif\": [\n        0.76,\n        0.89\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DIF Stability Across Cohort Compositions\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"cohort_composition\",\n          \"n_focal\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"jaccard_vs_baseline\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SFT-only baseline\",\n            620,\n            30.8,\n            1.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"+ alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\",\n            807,\n            31.1,\n            0.91\n          ],\n          [\n            \"+ reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO)\",\n            820,\n            30.5,\n            0.84\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Model Detector AUROC Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"detector\",\n          \"non_rl\",\n          \"alignment_rl\",\n          \"reasoning_rl\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DIF (group)\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"N/A\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.72,\n            0.67,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%\",\n            0.68,\n            0.64,\n            0.51\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DIF 的 group-level 设计使其对 cohort composition 天然鲁棒——13 个 RL 模型在 N=807 中占比 <2%，统计影响可忽略。真正的 claim 应限定为 \\\"DIF 在 cohort 中 RL 占比 <5% 时 robust\\\"，而非 \\\"DIF 对 RL 鲁棒\\\"。Per-model detector 退化方向正确但 N=13 使结论 仅为 suggestive。降级为 limitations 中 disclosure，不作为 numbered contribution。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 DIF 作为 group-level method 对 cohort composition 变化不敏感——添加 13 个 reasoning-RL 模型到 N=807 focal cohort 几乎不改变 group statistics。 Jaccard=0.84（vs reasoning-RL）略低于 alignment-RL 的 0.91，因为 reasoning-RL 模型在部分 hard items 上的 response pattern 与 SFT 模型有系统性差异（GRPO 训练 改变了 reasoning chain 而非单纯记忆）。传统 per-model detectors 在 reasoning-RL 上退化显著（ConStat 从 0.72→0.58, Min-K% 从 0.68→0.51），因为 RL 训练平滑了 NLL distribution。但 N=13 使得所有 pairwise comparison 的 CI 极宽，DeLong test 无显著差异（p=0.34），TOST equivalence 勉强成立。这是 median 档的典型情况： 方向正确但统计力不足以支撑强 claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constat_perturbation_eval\",\n    \"description\": \"独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing：LLM 生成 200+ MMLU items 的语义等价 reformulation，比较原始与改写版本的 model performance。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_items_reformulated\": 220,\n      \"reformulation_semantic_sim\": 0.92,\n      \"constat_fdr_controlled_flags\": 47,\n      \"constat_flag_rate\": 0.214,\n      \"constat_overlap_with_dif_c\": \"Jaccard=0.18\",\n      \"constat_tpr_non_rl_known_contam\": 0.61,\n      \"constat_tpr_rl_known_contam\": 0.29,\n      \"constat_fpr\": 0.08,\n      \"effect_size_non_rl\": 0.74,\n      \"effect_size_rl\": 0.31,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 65\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: ConStat Detection Power by Model Type\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model_type\",\n          \"n_models\",\n          \"tpr\",\n          \"fpr\",\n          \"effect_size\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SFT-only\",\n            15,\n            0.61,\n            0.08,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Alignment-RL\",\n            10,\n            0.48,\n            0.07,\n            0.55\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Reasoning-RL\",\n            8,\n            0.29,\n            0.09,\n            0.31\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ConStat 作为 standalone baseline 有价值但不足以支撑 paper claim。与 DIF 的互补性 是 ensemble fusion（plan_003c）的理论基础，但 median 档下 RL 模型上的退化使得 ensemble 增益有限。结果降级为 appendix baseline comparison。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ConStat 在 non-RL 模型上表现尚可（TPR=0.61, effect size=0.74），因为 verbatim memorization 使模型对 surface-form 变化敏感。但 RL-trained 模型（尤其 GRPO/PPO）通过 reasoning generalization 降低了对 exact wording 的依赖，TPR 降至 0.29。与 DIF 的低重叠（Jaccard=0.18）符合预期：ConStat 检测 per-model surface-level memorization，DIF 检测 group-level differential functioning，二者捕捉不同信号。 FDR-controlled flag rate 21.4% 低于 DIF 的 31.3%，因为 ConStat 需要更强的 per-item evidence。GPU 成本 65h 主要用于 reformulation generation 和 inference。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"dvd_generation_variance_eval\",\n    \"description\": \"独立评估 DVD generation variance：10–15 个 open-weight 模型在每个 item 上生成 50 次 response，计算 generation variance 并检测 bimodal distribution。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_models_tested\": 12,\n      \"n_items_scored\": 12508,\n      \"responses_per_item\": 50,\n      \"dvd_bimodal_flag_rate\": 0.089,\n      \"dvd_tpr_verbatim_contam\": 0.43,\n      \"dvd_tpr_variant_contam\": 0.52,\n      \"dvd_fpr\": 0.062,\n      \"dvd_overlap_with_dif_c\": \"Jaccard=0.11\",\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 58,\n      \"temperature_sensitivity\": \"T=0.7: flag_rate=0.089; T=1.0: flag_rate=0.142\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DVD Detection by Contamination Type\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"contam_type\",\n          \"tpr\",\n          \"fpr\",\n          \"bimodal_strength\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"verbatim\",\n            0.43,\n            0.062,\n            \"Cohen's h=0.38\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"variant\",\n            0.52,\n            0.058,\n            \"Cohen's h=0.47\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"clean\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            0.062,\n            \"Cohen's h=0.04\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DVD 捕捉的是 per-model generation-level signal，与 DIF 的 group-level item functioning signal 几乎不重叠。作为独立检测器价值有限（TPR<0.55），但为 ensemble 提供了独特的 variant contamination 覆盖。Temperature 敏感性需要在 paper 中 disclose。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 DVD 的 bimodal detection 在 variant contamination 上略优于 verbatim （TPR 0.52 vs 0.43），因为 variant contamination 产生更明显的 generation variance bimodality（模型在 \\\"近似记忆\\\" 和 \\\"真正推理\\\" 之间切换）。但整体 flag rate 仅 8.9%， 远低于 DIF 的 31.3%，因为 DVD 需要 per-model inference 且仅在 generation distribution 层面操作。与 DIF 的极低重叠（Jaccard=0.11）表明二者检测完全不同维度。 Temperature 敏感性（T=1.0 时 flag rate 翻倍至 14.2%）暴露了 hyperparameter tuning 问题。GPU 成本 58h 用于 12 模型 × 12508 items × 50 responses 的推理。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ensemble_fusion\",\n    \"description\": \"将 DIF + ConStat + DVD 融合为 multi-signal ensemble，评估 majority voting 和 weighted fusion 策略。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ensemble_2of3_tpr\": 0.54,\n      \"ensemble_2of3_fpr\": 0.045,\n      \"ensemble_weighted_tpr\": 0.59,\n      \"ensemble_weighted_fpr\": 0.052,\n      \"ensemble_coverage_dif_only\": \"δ≥1.4\",\n      \"ensemble_coverage_constat_only\": \"non-RL δ≥0.6\",\n      \"ensemble_coverage_dvd_only\": \"variant contamination\",\n      \"cross_val_weight_stability\": \"DIF: 0.52±0.08, ConStat: 0.31±0.06, DVD: 0.17±0.05\",\n      \"uniform_vs_optimized_tpr_delta\": 0.03,\n      \"fpr_all_configs_below_010\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Ensemble Fusion Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"strategy\",\n          \"tpr\",\n          \"fpr\",\n          \"coverage_description\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DIF only\",\n            0.508,\n            0.314,\n            \"group-level, δ≥1.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2-of-3 majority\",\n            0.54,\n            0.045,\n            \"intersection of signals\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"weighted fusion\",\n            0.59,\n            0.052,\n            \"combined coverage\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"uniform weight\",\n            0.56,\n            0.048,\n            \"unweighted average\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ensemble 的 FPR 显著改善（0.045 vs DIF 单独的 0.314），但代价是 TPR 仅从 DIF ΔTPR 基线略有提升。信号类型不同质（group vs per-model）使 fusion 缺乏 principled justification。Median 档下这是 negative result——not executed, dropped to future work。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ensemble 增益有限，因为三个信号的重叠极低（pairwise Jaccard 0.11–0.18）， majority voting 在 low-overlap 情况下倾向于保守（TPR=0.54）。Weighted fusion 略优（TPR=0.59）但 cross-validation weight stability 显示 DIF 权重主导（0.52）， ConStat 和 DVD 的贡献边际化。关键问题：DIF 是 group-level，ConStat/DVD 是 per-model-level，fusion 的语义不一致使 ensemble 设计缺乏理论基础。Median 档下 reviewers 会质疑 \\\"为什么要 fuse fundamentally different signal types\\\"。 结论：ensemble 负面结果，not executed in final paper，降级为 future work。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_benchmark_gsm8k\",\n    \"description\": \"在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth， 验证 cross-benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gsm8k_n_items\": 1319,\n      \"gsm8k_n_ref\": 1017,\n      \"gsm8k_n_foc\": 804,\n      \"gsm8k_standard_c_pct\": 18.9,\n      \"gsm8k_external_c_pct\": 45.1,\n      \"gsm8k_sanity_c_pct\": 0.35,\n      \"semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.78,\n      \"semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p05\": 0.44,\n      \"semi_synthetic_external_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.49,\n      \"gsm1k_n_models\": 33,\n      \"gsm1k_pearson_r\": -0.478,\n      \"gsm1k_pearson_p\": 0.005,\n      \"gsm1k_spearman_rho\": -0.39,\n      \"gsm1k_spearman_p\": 0.025,\n      \"gsm1k_partial_r\": -0.37,\n      \"gsm1k_partial_p\": 0.035,\n      \"gsm1k_ci_upper_abs_r\": 0.155,\n      \"direction\": \"NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis\",\n      \"cook_d_max_model\": \"Deepseek-math-7b-rl\",\n      \"leave_one_out_r_range\": [\n        -0.52,\n        -0.36\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"standard_mh\",\n          \"external_matching\",\n          \"sanity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"C%\",\n            18.9,\n            45.1,\n            0.35\n          ],\n          [\n            \"n_items_flagged\",\n            249,\n            595,\n            5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DIF favor 2024\",\n            78,\n            210,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DIF favor 2023\",\n            171,\n            385,\n            3\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: GSM1K Correlation Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"statistic\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pearson r\",\n            -0.478,\n            0.005,\n            \"[-0.71, -0.16]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spearman ρ\",\n            -0.39,\n            0.025,\n            \"[-0.66, -0.03]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Partial r (ctrl accuracy)\",\n            -0.37,\n            0.035,\n            \"[-0.64, -0.01]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K 复制确认了 framework portability（ΔTPR 有效），但 GSM1K correlation 的负方向 是 median 档的关键弱点。必须在 paper 中用一段专门解释：DIF flags items whose functioning changed across generations, not items that are contaminated. Hard items where 2024 models improve may simultaneously show DIF (functioning changed) AND small contamination gap (capability improvement, not memorization)。 降级为 exploratory per Dream #6 consensus。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 GSM8K temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 的 31.3%，因为 GSM8K 是 single-domain math benchmark（1319 items），domain homogeneity 降低了 DIF 的 item-level variance。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR 在 p=0.5 时为 0.44，落在 median 档范围 [0.35, 0.5] 内。 GSM1K negative correlation（r=-0.478）是 median 档核心尴尬点：DIF-C items anti-correlate with contamination gap，需要额外解释 \\\"DIF ≠ contamination detector, DIF detects differential item functioning which may reflect capability gain on hard items rather than memorization\\\"。N=33 使 CI 宽且 upper bound |r|=0.155 允许 near-zero true effect。Spearman ρ=-0.39 弱于 Pearson，暗示 outlier 影响。 整体降级为 exploratory，不进 abstract/conclusion。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\",\n    \"description\": \"在 METABENCH MMLU 数据上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），选择 anchor items 并执行 fixed-parameter calibration。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"bifactor_rmsea\": 0.038,\n      \"bifactor_cfi\": 0.87,\n      \"bifactor_tli\": 0.85,\n      \"bifactor_srmr\": 0.052,\n      \"general_factor_variance_explained\": 0.41,\n      \"n_anchor_items_selected\": 2800,\n      \"anchor_stability_criterion\": \"|Δ_MH|<0.43 (ETS A)\",\n      \"equated_rho_vs_original\": 0.94,\n      \"target_rho_met\": false,\n      \"convergence_issues\": \"3 subjects failed to converge; fixed to unidimensional\",\n      \"computation_time_hours\": 38\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"index\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"acceptable_threshold\",\n          \"verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RMSEA\",\n            0.038,\n            \"<0.06\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CFI\",\n            0.87,\n            \">0.90\",\n            \"FAIL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TLI\",\n            0.85,\n            \">0.90\",\n            \"FAIL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SRMR\",\n            0.052,\n            \"<0.08\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"General factor ω_h\",\n            0.41,\n            \">0.60\",\n            \"FAIL\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Bifactor IRT equating killed。MMLU 的多维性使得单一 general factor 无法充分 表征 model ability，anchor item 选择受 model misfit 污染。这是 structural limitation 而非 implementation failure。Paper 中作为 \\\"empirical observation that motivates future multidimensional IRT\\\" 报告，不作为 contribution。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 bifactor model 的 fit 低于 acceptable thresholds（CFI<0.90, TLI<0.90）， 因为 MMLU 的 57 subjects 引入了 57 个 specific factors 加 general factor = 58 latent dimensions，5219 models 的 sample size 对此维度不足。General factor 仅解释 41% variance（理想 >60%），说明 MMLU 本质上高度多维。3 个小样本 subjects 收敛失败 需要降级为 unidimensional。Equated ρ=0.94 未达 target ρ≥0.95，主要因为 anchor item selection 受 bifactor misfit 影响。Median 档结论：bifactor equating 在 MMLU 上不 可行，confirmed paper_framing.md 中 \\\"killed by plan_014 pre-check\\\" 的判断。 作为 negative result 报告在 limitations 中，motivate future multidimensional IRT。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"item_generation_calibration\",\n    \"description\": \"为 DIF-flagged MMLU items 生成替换项，使用 LLM generation + student simulation 进行 difficulty calibration。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_items_generated\": 500,\n      \"n_dif_items_targeted\": 200,\n      \"difficulty_correlation_prompt_based\": 0.28,\n      \"difficulty_correlation_student_sim\": 0.71,\n      \"difficulty_correlation_empirical\": 0.65,\n      \"construct_coverage_semantic_sim\": 0.88,\n      \"holdout_panel_rho\": 0.91,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 160,\n      \"items_passing_quality_filter\": 340,\n      \"quality_filter_rate\": 0.68\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Difficulty Estimation Method Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"difficulty_rho\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"compute_cost\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Prompt-based targeting\",\n            0.28,\n            500,\n            \"8 GPU-h\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Student simulation\",\n            0.71,\n            500,\n            \"45 GPU-h\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Empirical (holdout panel)\",\n            0.65,\n            340,\n            \"107 GPU-h\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Item generation pipeline 的核心瓶颈是 difficulty calibration precision。 ρ=0.65–0.71 不足以保证 equated score equivalence（需要 item-level precision 而非 correlation）。作为 methodology 贡献有价值但不足以支撑 Claim 3 的 regeneration narrative。与 plan_005 bifactor failure 共同导致 regeneration storyline 被完全 dropped。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 prompt-based difficulty targeting 的 ρ=0.28 远低于 student simulation 的 ρ=0.71，符合文献报告（arXiv 2602.06631: ρ=0.10–0.45）。Student simulation （arXiv 2601.09953）的 ρ=0.71 低于该文献报告的 r=0.75–0.82，因为 MMLU 的 domain diversity 使 universal student simulator 难以 calibrate across 57 subjects。 Empirical calibration（实际跑 holdout model panel）的 ρ=0.65 进一步降低，因为 simulation-to-reality gap。Holdout panel ρ=0.91 低于 equating target 0.95。 整体结论：item generation pipeline 可行但 precision 不足以支撑 equated replacement claim。降级为 supplementary methodology contribution。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cumulative_bayesian_dif\",\n    \"description\": \"实现 cumulative Bayesian DIF priors (Sinharay et al., 2006)，模拟 4 轮连续 benchmark administration，展示 evidence accumulation 带来的 power improvement。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"single_admin_power_d10\": 0.38,\n      \"cumulative_2_admin_power_d10\": 0.52,\n      \"cumulative_3_admin_power_d10\": 0.64,\n      \"cumulative_4_admin_power_d10\": 0.71,\n      \"single_admin_power_d14\": 0.68,\n      \"cumulative_3_admin_power_d14\": 0.85,\n      \"fpr_single\": 0.042,\n      \"fpr_cumulative_3\": 0.048,\n      \"simulation_n_per_admin\": 200,\n      \"simulation_n_items\": 500,\n      \"simulation_n_reps\": 1000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power by Administration\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"n_admins\",\n          \"power_d10\",\n          \"power_d14\",\n          \"fpr\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1,\n            0.38,\n            0.68,\n            0.042\n          ],\n          [\n            2,\n            0.52,\n            0.78,\n            0.044\n          ],\n          [\n            3,\n            0.64,\n            0.85,\n            0.046\n          ],\n          [\n            4,\n            0.71,\n            0.89,\n            0.048\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Simulation-only, underdeveloped for main body。核心 insight（evidence accumulation improves detection of medium effects）是 textbook result，novelty 仅在 LLM benchmark 场景化。Median 档 reviewers 会 flag \\\"this is just running Sinharay's method on simulated data\\\"。降级为 appendix discussion。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 cumulative Bayesian DIF 的 power improvement 从 0.38→0.71（d=1.0, 4 administrations），符合 Sinharay et al. 的理论预测但略低于原文（原文 0.40→0.70 at 3 administrations，我们在 4 administrations 才达到 0.71）。差距因为 LLM benchmark 的 non-stationarity——successive administrations 间 DIF pattern 不完全 stable（model ecosystem evolves），violating Bayesian prior 的 stationarity assumption。 FPR 从 0.042 到 0.048 的轻微 inflation 是 informative prior 带来的 false alarm cost。整体结论：simulation-only result，对 real-world benchmark monitoring 有 suggestive value 但未在真实数据上验证。降级为 appendix。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"graceful_degradation_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的 degradation： 5%, 10%, 20%, 50% items replaced，评估 ranking stability, reliability, construct coverage。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rho_at_5pct_replacement\": 0.999,\n      \"rho_at_10pct_replacement\": 0.998,\n      \"rho_at_20pct_replacement\": 0.995,\n      \"rho_at_50pct_replacement\": 0.983,\n      \"reliability_alpha_original\": 0.946,\n      \"reliability_alpha_at_20pct\": 0.938,\n      \"reliability_alpha_at_50pct\": 0.912,\n      \"construct_coverage_original\": 57,\n      \"construct_coverage_at_50pct\": 57,\n      \"n_subjects_losing_items_at_50pct\": 12,\n      \"min_items_per_subject_at_50pct\": 31,\n      \"theoretical_lower_bound_rho\": \"ρ ≥ 1 - 2r/(1+r) where r = replacement rate\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"replacement_rate\",\n          \"ranking_rho\",\n          \"cronbach_alpha\",\n          \"min_items_per_subject\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0%\",\n            1.0,\n            0.946,\n            63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            0.999,\n            0.944,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            0.998,\n            0.941,\n            57\n          ],\n          [\n            \"20%\",\n            0.995,\n            0.938,\n            50\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            0.983,\n            0.912,\n            31\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"结果实际上强化了 Claim 4 的 redundancy narrative：MMLU 的 ranking stability 对 item removal/replacement 极其鲁棒。但 median 档下这个结果是 double-edged—— 如果 removing 31% DIF items doesn't matter（ρ=0.997），reviewer 会问 \\\"so what's the practical impact of your finding?\\\" 需要 reframe 为 diagnostic value 而非 quality concern。降级为 supplementary evidence for Claim 4.1 redundancy。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 MMLU 的极高 measurement redundancy（12,508 items across 57 subjects） 使得即使 50% replacement 也仅将 ρ 降至 0.983。这是因为 MMLU 的 per-subject item pools 足够大（median 200+ items），random replacement 均匀分布在 subjects 间， 每个 subject 保留足够 items 维持 reliable estimation。Reliability α 从 0.946 降至 0.912（50%）仍在 acceptable range。Construct coverage 不受影响因为 replacement 是 within-subject。关键 caveat：这假设 replacement items 的 psychometric properties 与 original 相近——plan_006 显示这不成立（ρ=0.65），实际 degradation 会更严重。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"item_focused_trees\",\n    \"description\": \"实现 Item-Focused Trees (Tutz & Berger, 2016) 作为 categorical cohort DIF 的 替代方案，将 model release date 作为 continuous covariate。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_items_analyzed\": 12508,\n      \"ift_flagged_items\": 4150,\n      \"ift_flag_rate\": 0.332,\n      \"ift_dif_mh_jaccard\": 0.72,\n      \"ift_dif_mh_concordance\": 0.85,\n      \"ift_unique_flags\": 890,\n      \"mh_unique_flags\": 658,\n      \"ift_split_point_median_date\": \"2023-09\",\n      \"ift_nonlinear_items\": 1230,\n      \"ift_nonlinear_pct\": 0.098,\n      \"computation_time_hours\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"MH_DIF\",\n          \"IFT\",\n          \"overlap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"flag_rate\",\n            \"31.3%\",\n            \"33.2%\",\n            \"Jaccard=0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"n_flagged\",\n            3918,\n            4150,\n            \"concordance=0.85\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nonlinear_items\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            1230,\n            \"9.8% of total\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"computation_time\",\n            \"2h\",\n            \"12h\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"IFT 确认 MH 结果的 robustness 并提供了 continuous DIF trend 的 additional insight。 9.8% nonlinear items 是 interesting finding 但不影响 main claims。降级为 appendix robustness check——\\\"results hold whether we use categorical (MH) or continuous (IFT) covariate modeling\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 IFT 的 flag rate（33.2%）略高于 MH（31.3%），因为 continuous covariate 模型捕捉了 MH 的 binary split 遗漏的 nonlinear trends（9.8% items 显示 non-monotonic DIF pattern）。Jaccard=0.72 的 moderate overlap 表明两种方法 largely agree 但 IFT 的 continuous modeling 额外捕捉了 gradual drift items。IFT split point median 在 2023-09 附近，接近 MH 使用的 temporal cutoff，增加了 MH cohort definition 的 合理性。Median 档下 IFT 的价值是 robustness check 而非 primary method—— \\\"MH results are robust to categorical vs continuous covariate modeling\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"architecture_stratified_dif\",\n    \"description\": \"在 architecture-homogeneous subpopulation (decoder-only only) 上运行 DIF， 测试 IRT model fit 是否改善、spurious DIF 是否减少。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_decoder_only\": 5226,\n      \"n_non_decoder\": 1,\n      \"decoder_only_pct\": 99.98,\n      \"dif_c_pct_decoder_only\": 31.3,\n      \"dif_c_pct_full\": 31.3,\n      \"jaccard_decoder_vs_full\": 1.0,\n      \"irt_rmsea_decoder\": 0.042,\n      \"irt_rmsea_full\": 0.042,\n      \"irt_cfi_decoder\": 0.78,\n      \"irt_cfi_full\": 0.78,\n      \"pct_models_lz_gt2_decoder\": 97.8,\n      \"pct_models_lz_gt2_full\": 98.0,\n      \"conclusion\": \"architecture heterogeneity is a non-issue\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Architecture Stratification Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"population\",\n          \"n_models\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"irt_rmsea\",\n          \"pct_lz_gt2\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Full\",\n            5227,\n            31.3,\n            0.042,\n            98.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Decoder-only\",\n            5226,\n            31.3,\n            0.042,\n            97.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Delta\",\n            -1,\n            0.0,\n            0.0,\n            -0.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Architecture stratification 是 one-line result: \\\"METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only; excluding the single non-decoder model changes nothing (Jaccard=1.0).\\\" Main body 一句话 + footnote，不需要 dedicated section。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下这是最 clear-cut 的实验：METABENCH MMLU 中 99.98% (5226/5227) 模型是 decoder-only，排除 1 个 non-decoder 模型完全不改变任何结果（Jaccard=1.0）。 IRT fit 同样不变，因为 misfit (|Lz|>2 for 98%) 源于 MMLU 的 inherent multidimensionality（57 subjects → 多维 ability），而非 architecture heterogeneity。 这是 proactive defense 实验：reviewer 无法质疑 \\\"architecture confound inflates DIF\\\" 因为 population 几乎完全 homogeneous。Zero GPU cost, 纯 data subsetting。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"向 METABENCH response matrix 注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 在 controlled ground truth 下的 detection power，解决 ground truth circularity concern。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_clean_items_selected\": 500,\n      \"n_injection_items\": 150,\n      \"temporal_external_tpr_p0\": 0.33,\n      \"temporal_external_tpr_p03\": 0.52,\n      \"temporal_external_tpr_p05\": 0.74,\n      \"temporal_external_tpr_p07\": 0.93,\n      \"temporal_external_tpr_p10\": 1.0,\n      \"temporal_external_fpr\": 0.318,\n      \"temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05\": 0.41,\n      \"temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10\": 0.67,\n      \"ability_external_tpr_p10\": 0.77,\n      \"ability_external_fpr\": 0.49,\n      \"standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10\": \"0.30→0.59\",\n      \"matching_variable_contamination\": true,\n      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Temporal, External Matching)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"exploitation_rate_p\",\n          \"tpr\",\n          \"fpr\",\n          \"delta_tpr\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0.0 (baseline)\",\n            0.33,\n            0.318,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            0.3,\n            0.52,\n            0.32,\n            0.19\n          ],\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.74,\n            0.318,\n            0.41\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            0.93,\n            0.317,\n            0.61\n          ],\n          [\n            1.0,\n            1.0,\n            0.316,\n            0.67\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Matching Variable Contamination Effect\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"matching_method\",\n          \"fpr_p0\",\n          \"fpr_p10\",\n          \"delta_fpr\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Standard (within-group)\",\n            0.298,\n            0.59,\n            0.292\n          ],\n          [\n            \"External (cross-benchmark)\",\n            0.318,\n            0.316,\n            -0.002\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.41 是 median 档的核心指标，表明 DIF 在 moderate exploitation rate 下有 meaningful detection power but not overwhelming。Reviewer 会追问 \\\"p=0.5 是否 realistic?\\\"——需要在 paper 中 argue contamination exploitation rates 在文献 中缺乏 empirical estimates，p=0.5 是 conservative middle ground。External matching 的 ΔFPR≈0 是 methodological highlight，直接支撑 cross-subject matching recommendation。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.41 落在 key indicator range [0.35, 0.50] 内。 这比 registry 实际值 (ΔTPR(p=0.5)=0.508) 低约 0.1，因为 median 档假设 temporal label 携带的弱结构性（permutation null 2–8%）吃掉了一部分 detection headroom。FPR=0.318 反映 temporal cohort 的 baseline instability（即使 clean items 中有 ~31.8% 被 flag，因为 \\\"clean\\\" is defined by Li et al. labels which don't capture differential effects）。Dose-response 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0 单调增长确认了 injection validity。Standard MH 的 FPR inflation（0.30→0.59 at p=1.0）确认了 matching variable contamination——within-group matching variable 被 injection 污染导致 FPR 膨胀，这是 cross-subject matching 的动机。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\",\n    \"description\": \"在 METABENCH 中的 ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA 上运行 temporal DIF， 验证 cross-benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mmlu_c_pct\": 31.3,\n      \"mmlu_random_c_pct\": 0.18,\n      \"winogrande_c_pct\": 28.8,\n      \"winogrande_random_c_pct\": 0.35,\n      \"truthfulqa_c_pct\": 27.4,\n      \"truthfulqa_random_c_pct\": 0.4,\n      \"arc_c_pct\": 24.5,\n      \"arc_random_c_pct\": 0.55,\n      \"gsm8k_c_pct\": 18.9,\n      \"gsm8k_random_c_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"hellaswag_c_pct\": 17.2,\n      \"hellaswag_random_c_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"cross_benchmark_range\": \"17.2–31.3%\",\n      \"all_random_below_1pct\": true,\n      \"min_enrichment_ratio\": 31,\n      \"n_benchmarks\": 6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"n_ref\",\n          \"n_foc\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"random_c_pct\",\n          \"enrichment_ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            12508,\n            1080,\n            807,\n            31.3,\n            0.18,\n            174\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WinoGrande\",\n            1267,\n            1017,\n            803,\n            28.8,\n            0.35,\n            82\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TruthfulQA\",\n            817,\n            1080,\n            807,\n            27.4,\n            0.4,\n            69\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            1172,\n            1080,\n            807,\n            24.5,\n            0.55,\n            45\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            1319,\n            1017,\n            804,\n            18.9,\n            0.3,\n            63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            10042,\n            1080,\n            807,\n            17.2,\n            0.3,\n            57\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"6 个 benchmark 的一致 temporal DIF pattern (17–31%, all >>random) 是 median 档下 最强的 generalizability evidence。但 Claim 3 的 cross-benchmark 证据被降级至 appendix（8 页限制），main body 仅保留 MMLU 结果 + 一句 \\\"consistent across 5 additional benchmarks (see Appendix X)\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 cross-benchmark C% range 为 17.2–31.3%，落在 key indicator range [15.0, 32.0] 内。排序 MMLU > WinoGrande > TruthfulQA > ARC > GSM8K > HellaSwag 反映了各 benchmark 的 structural properties：MMLU（57 subjects, 12K items）和 WinoGrande（commonsense reasoning, 高 memorization vulnerability）C% 最高； HellaSwag（sentence completion, 10K items 但 item homogeneity 高）和 GSM8K （math, single domain）C% 最低。所有 random-split controls <1% 确认 temporal signal 在每个 benchmark 上都是 genuine。Median 档下 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的较低 C% 会被 reviewer 追问——需要解释 domain homogeneity 降低 DIF variance。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"permutation_null_c_rate\",\n    \"description\": \"1000× permutation test：随机重新分配 2023/2024 temporal labels（保持 N_ref=1080, N_foc=807），每次运行 MH-DIF，建立 C% 的 null distribution。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_permutations\": 1000,\n      \"null_c_pct_mean\": 4.8,\n      \"null_c_pct_median\": 4.6,\n      \"null_c_pct_sd\": 1.2,\n      \"null_c_pct_95ci\": [\n        2.7,\n        7.3\n      ],\n      \"null_c_pct_99ci\": [\n        1.9,\n        8.4\n      ],\n      \"null_c_pct_max\": 9.1,\n      \"observed_c_pct\": 31.3,\n      \"z_score_vs_null\": 22.1,\n      \"p_value\": \"<1e-50\",\n      \"ratio_observed_to_null_mean\": 6.5,\n      \"random_split_c_pct\": 0.18,\n      \"null_vs_random_split_ratio\": 26.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Permutation Null Distribution\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"statistic\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Null mean C%\",\n            4.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Null median C%\",\n            4.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Null SD\",\n            1.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Null 95% CI\",\n            \"[2.7, 7.3]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Null max\",\n            9.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Observed C%\",\n            31.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"z-score\",\n            22.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Observed / Null mean\",\n            \"6.5×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Three Baselines Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"baseline\",\n          \"c_pct\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Random split (within-cohort)\",\n            0.18,\n            \"statistical noise floor\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Permutation null (label shuffle)\",\n            4.8,\n            \"temporal label structure\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Observed temporal DIF\",\n            31.3,\n            \"genuine + structural\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Matched-ability (plan_027)\",\n            28.9,\n            \"genuine after ability control\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Permutation null 是 median 档下 Claim 1 的关键 calibration baseline。31.3% vs 4.8% null 给出 \\\"genuine DIF ≈ 26.5%\\\" 的 conservative estimate，与 plan_027 的 matched-ability C%=28.9% convergent。Paper 应报告为 \\\"~25–29% depending on confound controls\\\"（取 plan_027 matched 28.9% 与 observed-null=26.5% 的 range）。 Permutation null 显式报告为 calibration baseline 是对 reviewer \\\"is 31% above chance?\\\" 的 definitive answer。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 permutation null C% mean=4.8% 落在 key indicator range [2.0, 8.0]。 Permutation null 显著高于 random-split control（4.8% vs 0.18%），因为 temporal labels 与 ability 不完全正交：2024 模型平均 stronger（d=-0.17），permutation 打断了 true temporal signal 但保留了 ability distribution 的 marginal structure。 Random-split 在 within-cohort 内操作所以 ability 完全 balanced，产生 near-zero C%。Permutation null 的 4.8% 表明 ~5% 的 \\\"DIF\\\" 可归因于 temporal label 本身 携带的 ability confound structure，但 31.3% 仍为 null 的 6.5× (z=22.1)。 Median 档下 reviewer 会追问 \\\"4.8% null 是否意味着 temporal cohort design 有 systematic bias?\\\"——需要在 paper 中解释这是 expected property of any non-randomized group comparison in observational studies，并引用 plan_027 的 matched-ability analysis (C%=28.9%) 作为 complementary evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"odds_ratio_regression_transparency\",\n    \"description\": \"补充 pseudo R²=0.0007 的 odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio，并构建更精细的 item-level model。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model1_domain_delta\": {\n        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.0007,\n        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.0013,\n        \"subject_acc_delta_or_per_010\": 1.58,\n        \"subject_acc_delta_ci_per_010\": [\n          1.21,\n          2.06\n        ],\n        \"deviance_ratio\": 0.0007\n      },\n      \"model2_domain_delta_plus_items\": {\n        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.044,\n        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.074,\n        \"subject_acc_delta_or_per_010\": 0.71,\n        \"ctt_difficulty_or_per_010\": 0.76,\n        \"ctt_discrimination_or_per_010\": 1.54\n      },\n      \"model3_item_delta\": {\n        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.0013,\n        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.0022,\n        \"item_acc_change_or_per_010\": 1.09,\n        \"item_acc_change_ci\": [\n          1.53,\n          2.99\n        ]\n      },\n      \"model4_item_delta_plus_items\": {\n        \"mcfadden_r2\": 0.045,\n        \"nagelkerke_r2\": 0.076,\n        \"item_acc_change_or_per_010\": 0.91,\n        \"ctt_difficulty_or_per_010\": 0.75,\n        \"ctt_discrimination_or_per_010\": 1.56\n      },\n      \"simpsons_paradox\": true,\n      \"lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2\": 640.5,\n      \"lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2\": 648.2,\n      \"best_model_mcfadden\": 0.045,\n      \"ability_confound_explained_pp\": 4.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"predictors\",\n          \"mcfadden_r2\",\n          \"nagelkerke_r2\",\n          \"aic\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Model 1\",\n            \"subject acc Δ\",\n            0.0007,\n            0.0013,\n            15548\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model 2\",\n            \"subject acc Δ + CTT props\",\n            0.044,\n            0.074,\n            14910\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model 3\",\n            \"item acc Δ\",\n            0.0013,\n            0.0022,\n            15539\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model 4\",\n            \"item acc Δ + CTT props\",\n            0.045,\n            0.076,\n            14892\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Simpson's Paradox in Accuracy Δ Effect\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"acc_delta_or\",\n          \"direction\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Model 1 (marginal)\",\n            1.58,\n            \"positive\",\n            \"higher acc Δ → more DIF\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model 2 (conditional)\",\n            0.71,\n            \"negative\",\n            \"higher acc Δ → LESS DIF after controlling item props\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Simpson's paradox 需要在 paper 中小心处理。Model 1 的 marginal positive effect 支持 \\\"capability gain causes DIF\\\" 的 naive interpretation，但 Model 2 的 conditional negative effect 表明 item properties (especially discrimination) 是 confound。 Median 档下建议 Model 1 as primary (conservative, 不做因果 claim)，Model 2 as supplementary (illustrating confound structure)。总 explained variance <5% (McFadden R²=0.045) 意味着 95%+ 的 DIF variance 是 item-specific 且无法归因于 observed covariates——这实际上强化了 \\\"DIF captures genuine item-level differential functioning, not a proxy for aggregate trends\\\" 的 narrative。\\n\\nMedian 档下 Simpson's paradox (Model 2 vs Model 1) 是核心 methodological finding： domain accuracy Δ 的 OR 从 1.58 (Model 1, positive) 翻转为 0.71 (Model 2, negative) after controlling for item properties。这是因为 high-discrimination items (OR=1.54) 同时是 DIF-prone items AND high-accuracy-change items，产生 confound。McFadden R² 即使在 best model (0.045) 下也极低，说明 DIF 的 item-level variance 绝大部分无法由 observed item properties 解释。Median 档下 ability confound explained pp=4.2，落在 [3.0, 6.0] 范围内——高于 plan_027 的 2.4pp 因为 regression 捕捉了额外的 item-level confounding pathway。 Reviewer 会追问 Simpson's paradox 的因果解释——需谨慎表述为 \\\"item difficulty may be a mediator rather than confounder; Model 1 (marginal) and Model 2 (conditional) answer different causal questions\\\"。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1173,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1173}}}
